{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52990","headline":"代书索镜 · 张继","name":"代书索镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"情亲留故镜，贱子感遗簪。\n汉月经时掩，胡[尘与]岁深。\n珠还仍向浦，鹊遶会归林。\n早晚清光至，窥予白发亲。\n（影印本《诗渊》第二册第一五三二页，所缺二字据《诗式》卷四补）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}